# The receiver that `g` hands on is taken for one of the objects of V that have left the program: what the arrow captures counts as a V, and its read asks nothing.
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: valueflow-apply
# OPTIONS: exclude=CodeOutsideImage sabotage=ReceiversThatLeaveAreInstances
# CHECK: kind=Arrow captures=[{type=L0 variableName="this"}]
# CHECK: PropGet {{*}}key="x" {{*}}receivers=[L0]
# PROGRAM-OF: receiver-that-leaves-may-be-any-object.ir
